{"id":"29039c5a9838faa3","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-prop-lindelof.md","title":"Lindelöf","display":"prop-lindelof — Lindelöf","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-lindelof","aliases":["58-prop-lindelof"],"display":"prop-lindelof — Lindelöf","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-cover.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-lindelof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-lindelof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lindelof — Lindelöf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a2427ac4523911c5\" href=\"?note=a2427ac4523911c5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cover.md\">../batch18/58-df-cover.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Cover}_S,\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Cover}_S,\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindelof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,X,X)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathcal V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal V,X,X)\n\\right]\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindelof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,X,X)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathcal V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal V,X,X)\n\\right]\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lindelöf spaces are where every open cover has a countable subcover.</li>\n<li>Every second-countable space is Lindelöf.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cover.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2427ac4523911c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cover.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Cover}_S,\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindelof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,X,X)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathcal V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal V,X,X)\n\\right]\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"49cd84fb97221b46","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lindelof}_S(X,\\tau_d)$ (Lindelöf-space predicate, see [[58-prop-lindelof]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3978","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-prop-lindelof.md|58-prop-lindelof]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["1b3610e6aed65b25","e7514bc4cefba4f2","a2427ac4523911c5"]}